          "copies/zv884mc0794.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "Stamped in black on the bare red paper, the line running diagonally across the roll at about sixty degrees; read after rotating. Five figures with no separators, 2 9 8 2 5, so 29.8.25 on the corpus convention. The third figure is blotted, but thresholding shows two loops each closed on the left, which makes it an 8 and not a 3."
        }
       ]
